2026-06-10 @ 15:45  Initial project creation

  Created the complete project from scratch with the following structure:

  Application source (app/src/):
  - index.php   Front-controller and home page showing pod layout.
  - db.php      Live MariaDB connectivity test (server version, uptime).
  - info.php    PHP runtime details (version, loaded extensions).

  Docker build context – php-fpm (docker/php-fpm/):
  - Dockerfile       Ubuntu 26.04 minimal base.  Installs php-fpm and
                     php-mysql only.  PHP version auto-discovered at build
                     time; stable symlinks created for config and binary so
                     the entrypoint is version-agnostic.  Application
                     deployed from app.tar.gz archive as required.
  - entrypoint.sh    Starts cron daemon then launches php-fpm -F -R.
  - config/php-fpm.conf   Global PHP-FPM config (no daemon, stderr logging).
  - config/www.conf        Pool config: TCP listen 0.0.0.0:9000, dynamic PM,
                           workers run as www-data.
  - config/security-updates  cron.d rule: daily apt security upgrade at 03:15.

  Docker build context – nginx (docker/nginx/):
  - Dockerfile       Ubuntu 26.04 minimal base.  Installs nginx only.
                     Temp paths moved to /tmp so worker can run without root
                     privileges on the filesystem.
  - entrypoint.sh    Validates config, starts cron, then runs nginx in
                     foreground (daemon off).
  - config/nginx.conf      Main nginx config; access/error log to
                           stdout/stderr via /proc/self/fd.
  - config/default.conf    Virtual host: listen 8080, all requests proxied
                           to PHP-FPM at 127.0.0.1:9000 via FastCGI with
                           SCRIPT_FILENAME pointing to the php-fpm
                           container's /var/www/html.
  - config/security-updates  cron.d rule: daily apt security upgrade at 03:30.

  Build and deployment scripts (scripts/):
  - package-app.sh   Creates docker/php-fpm/app.tar.gz from app/src/.
  - build.sh         Calls package-app.sh then docker build for both images
                     using --no-cache --pull.
  - push.sh          Authenticates with the registry and pushes both images.
  - deploy.sh        Generates values.local.yaml from .config, runs
                     helm upgrade --install, then deletes values.local.yaml.

  Helm chart (helm/php-demo/):
  - Chart.yaml
  - values.yaml           Checked-in defaults; no secrets.
  - .helmignore           Excludes values.local.yaml.
  - templates/_helpers.tpl
  - templates/deployment.yaml   Single pod with nginx, php-fpm, and mariadb
                                 containers sharing the network namespace.
  - templates/service.yaml      ClusterIP service on port 8080.
  - templates/ingress.yaml      TLS ingress with cert-manager annotation.
  - templates/configmap.yaml    nginx and PHP-FPM runtime configs mounted
                                 over image defaults.
  - templates/secret.yaml       MariaDB credentials as Opaque Secret.
  - templates/pvc.yaml          1 Gi PersistentVolumeClaim for MariaDB data.
  - templates/NOTES.txt

  Root files:
  - .gitignore        Excludes .config, generated tar archives, and
                      values.local.yaml.
  - .config.example   Safe-to-commit template for the .config file.
